  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development would result in the loss of one residential unit through the conversion of two purpose-built maisonettes into a single dwelling contrary to Policy H11.2 of the Merton Local Plan 2024, which seeks to retain existing housing stock to meet local needs. Furthermore, the proposal would undermine the established housing mix within the wider area, in which purpose-built maisonettes on Braeside Avenue make a positive contribution to the area's character and diversity of accommodation. \r\nThe development would therefore also conflict with Policy H11.3 of the Merton Local Plan 2024, which seeks to maintain a balanced housing mix. Approval of this scheme could set an undesirable precedent for similar conversions, further exacerbating the harm identified.\r\n"
